{
  "about": "Markdown in, HTML out: one case per construct of the guide's Markdown. Read by test/js/guideMarkdown.test.js (js/guideMarkdown.js) and pkg/web/guide_markdown_test.go (pkg/web/guide_markdown.go), each with its renderer's default options: the two must give this same HTML.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "heading levels",
      "markdown": "# One\n## Two\n### Three\n#### Four\n###### Six\n#No space",
      "html": "<h1>One</h1>\n<h2>Two</h2>\n<h3>Three</h3>\n<h3>Four</h3>\n<h3>Six</h3>\n<p>#No space</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "heading with inline",
      "markdown": "# Title *one* and **two**",
      "html": "<h1>Title <em>one</em> and <strong>two</strong></h1>"
    },
    {
      "name": "paragraphs joined and split",
      "markdown": "first line\n  second line  \n\nnew paragraph",
      "html": "<p>first line second line</p>\n<p>new paragraph</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "paragraph stops at a block",
      "markdown": "text\n- item\ntext again\n> quote",
      "html": "<p>text</p>\n<ul><li>item</li></ul>\n<p>text again</p>\n<blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>"
    },
    {
      "name": "crlf line ends",
      "markdown": "one\r\ntwo\r\rthree",
      "html": "<p>one two</p>\n<p>three</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "bold and italic",
      "markdown": "a **bold** b *italic* c **x*y** d ***both***",
      "html": "<p>a <strong>bold</strong> b <em>italic</em> c **x<em>y<strong> d </strong></em>both***</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "underscore italic",
      "markdown": "_start_ mid _word_, snake_case_name and (_paren_) _a_b_ x _end_",
      "html": "<p><em>start</em> mid <em>word</em>, snake_case_name and (<em>paren</em>) _a_b_ x <em>end</em></p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "underscore italic chain",
      "markdown": "_a_ _b_._c_ é_d_é",
      "html": "<p><em>a</em> <em>b</em>.<em>c</em> é<em>d</em>é</p>"
