    {
      "name": "topic links",
      "markdown": "[Horse](34), [zeros](007), [code](27a2), [old](page:12), [hash](#5)",
      "html": "<p><a data-topic=\"34\">Horse</a>, <a data-topic=\"7\">zeros</a>, <a data-topic=\"27A2\">code</a>, <a data-topic=\"12\">old</a>, <a data-topic=\"5\">hash</a></p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "web and other links",
      "markdown": "[web](https://x.y/a?b=1&c=2), [http](http://x.y), [file](other.html) and [too long](123456789)",
      "html": "<p><a href=\"https://x.y/a?b=1&amp;c=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">web</a>, <a href=\"http://x.y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http</a>, file and too long</p>"
    },
    {
