      "html": "<ul><li>one continued<ul><li>nested <img src=\"item:no_such\" alt=\"x\"><ul><li>deeper</li></ul></li></ul></li><li>two<ol><li>inner ordered</li></ol></li></ul>\n<p>after</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "list with blank line",
      "markdown": "- a\n\n- b",
