    {
      "name": "rules",
      "markdown": "---\n***\n___\n  ---  \n----",
      "html": "<hr>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<p>----</p>"
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed document",
      "markdown": "# Title\n\nIntro with [link](1).\n\n## Section\n\n- a\n- b\n\n| X |\n|---|\n| y |\n\n> note\n\n---\nend",
      "html": "<h1>Title</h1>\n<p>Intro with <a data-topic=\"1\">link</a>.</p>\n<h2>Section</h2>\n<ul><li>a</li><li>b</li></ul>\n<table><thead><tr><th>X</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>y</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote><p>note</p></blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>end</p>"
    }
  ]
}
